is bleeding. Most losses are stop-outs, not time exits. Mean reversion firing into strong trends. USTEC/XAU now deeply oversold - momentum still negative, wrong to fade yet. 73h idle suggests conditions too strict or weekend closure.", "mistakes": ["Fading momentum into trending moves: USTEC shorted at 28449 then 28582 while in downtrend - mean reversion against trend is dangerous", "Stop too tight at 1.1% on 1h causing frequent stop-outs (8 of 15 trades stopped out); reward rarely reached before reversal", "Trading EURAUD and AUDJPY with 0.16-0.033% spread eats edge on small moves; spread cost disproportionate to avg win", "No trend filter: entering longs/shorts purely on RSI/BB without confirming broader direction led to catching falling knives"], "changes": ["Add trend filter (price_vs_sma 50) to only trade mean reversion in direction of higher-timeframe trend", "Widen stops to 1.5-1.8% to survive noise, compensate with larger R:R target 3R", "Remove expensive spread markets (ETH, SOL, EURAUD) from mean reversion; keep USTEC and XAU only", "Relax entry: drop momentum filter or loosen threshold - it was blocking valid oversold entries", "Extend maxHoldMinutes to 1440 (24h) so winners have time to develop"], "tournament": [{"name": "TrendAligned_MeanReversion_1h_USTEC_XAU", "tf": "1h", "net": -5.6, "trades": 3, "pf": 0.72, "winner": true}, {"name": "Breakout_Momentum_1h_USTEC_CHFJPY", "tf": "1h", "net": -25.39, "trades": 5, "pf": 0.22, "winner": false}, {"name": "DeepOversold_Bounce_15m_USTEC_XAU_BTC", "tf": "15m", "net": -10.39, "trades": 3, "pf": 0.48, "winner": false}], "strategy": {"name": "TrendAligned_MeanReversion_1h_USTEC_XAU", "version": 4, "timeframe": "1h", "markets": ["USTEC", "XAU"], "rationale": "Mean reversion only when price vs SMA50 aligns with oversold/overbought RSI below 30 or above 70, widened stops reduce false stops, extended hold allows targets to develop.", "longConditions": [{"indicator": "rsi", "period": 14, "op": "<", "value": 32}, {"ind